hat energy to work out an extra hour in the gym or crank through some spreadsheets at work</strong>, it's up to you - creatine has you covered.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="6710f4a6-fe5b-47cd-8b29-2fa8b02ea963" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="influencers" tabindex="-1" id="influencers" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-11ljx4h"><div data-rid="a9010a2d-57a8-46c4-b934-6e905d586c99" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-145a5ut"><div data-rid="5d4423d3-4fdb-4d48-9b6b-07e470c6e953" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-9hqr5w alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3. Accelerated strength gains and muscle recovery.</p></span></div><div data-rid="2057e711-df42-4e0b-ab98-abc742a6450a" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-rwof9n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Creatine supplementation boosts phosphocreatine stores, <strong>enhancing your power output, endurance, and resistance to fatigue during high-intensity training.</strong></p><br><p>After that grueling workout, creatine also <strong>substantially improves recovery</strong> and the core micro-tears accrued during exercise. You feel better the next day, and you're able to get right back to it.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="8d6b34c5-38a4-4311-aa5a-083a91f050d3" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-nal5tz"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_PercGainsvsPlacebo_WhiteBG_17bdfdd0-f630-445f-ac15-8150ab0122e0.png?v=1741023357&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_PercGainsvsPlacebo_WhiteBG_17bdfdd0-f630-445f-ac15-8150ab0122e0.png?v=1741023357&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_PercGainsvsPlacebo_WhiteBG_17bdfdd0-f630-445f-ac15-8150ab0122e0.png?v=1741023357&amp;widt